  "narrative": {
    "intro": "DDB Chicago has $303M in federal contract obligations for FY2026 to date. DDB Chicago has 11 awards this fiscal year, with an average award size of $27.6M. Obligations fell 22.4% year over year. Historical obligations show variation: FY21 was $348M, FY22 was $363M, FY23 was $596M, FY24 was $399M, and FY25 was $391M. The current-year total is partial and represents fiscal year to date activity rather than a full-year total. The data only reports obligations and award counts; award‑value figures in the largest-awards and expiring-contracts tables are total contract values rather than current-year obligations. Readers should treat the FY2026 figure as an in-progress total and compare fiscal years accordingly. The numbers show that FY23 was the peak year in the series and that FY26 obligations are lower than the most recent full fiscal years.",
